          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes the Wonder Pillow different from other pillows?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Wonder Pillow features an orthopedic curved shape for neck and head support, reducing neck and back pain. Made of high-quality memory foam, it contours well and includes a thermoregulating gel pad to disperse heat, keeping you cool while sleeping.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__22d11c55-434f-4d50-9e9c-9a2888634d94-16653295208e06c57f-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work for back and side sleepers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Wonder Pillow features an innovative ergonomic design that adapts to your neck and head without requiring you to adjust your sleeping position. It provides support and comfort in any sleeping posture, making it suitable for everyone, including side, back, and stomach sleepers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__22d11c55-434f-4d50-9e9c-9a2888634d94-16653295208e06c57f-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work for chronic neck pain?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Wonder Pillow’s distinctive shape and design make it a perfect choice for individuals dealing with chronic neck pain. It supports the natural curve of the neck and spine, ensuring your head stays aligned with your back. This helps alleviate pressure on the spinal nerves, which can contribute to chronic pain.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
