          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does the Wonder Leg Pillow work for back and side sleepers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Wonder Leg Pillow is ideal for side sleepers, offering spinal and hip alignment when placed between the knees during sleep. However, back sleepers can also benefit by positioning it under their knees for extra support at night.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
