          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I've used many pillows for back and hip pain and remain doubtful. How can I be sure this one will be effective for me?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We're confident that the Wonder Leg Pillow is the best solution for hip pain relief and will improve your sleep, which is why we offer a 30-night risk-free trial. If you don't experience a noticeable difference within this period, you can return it for a full refund, no questions asked!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
