      "blocks": {
        "template--16629616673011__93b6f24e-ec1e-48f0-aebb-e35e62bdffe9-16653295208e06c57f-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using a 100% Blackout Sleep Mask like yours?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The absence of light sends a signal to your body’s sleep clock that it is time to rest, so using our sleep mask will help you fall asleep faster and deeper.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__93b6f24e-ec1e-48f0-aebb-e35e62bdffe9-16653295208e06c57f-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the size adjustable? I am worried it won't fit me.",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We know that every face shape is different, so the Wonder Sleep Mask has adjustable cups that can be moved closer together or farther apart to perfectly fit your face! The velcro strap that secures the mask can also be adjusted for a tighter or looser fit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__93b6f24e-ec1e-48f0-aebb-e35e62bdffe9-16653295208e06c57f-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will this place pressure on my eyes or be uncomfortable while I try to sleep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely not! In fact, it’s very comfortable. Made with 100% cotton and soft foam, the Wonder Sleep Mask offers breathable and comfortable wear to help you sleep even better.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TM9wLa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wash my Wonder Sleep Mask?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You can gently hand wash your Wonder Sleep Mask and hang it to dry. Please DO NOT use the washing machine for your Wonder Sleep Mask as this may damage the fabric and foam.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__93b6f24e-ec1e-48f0-aebb-e35e62bdffe9-16653295208e06c57f-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it work with eyelash extensions?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It depends on the length of your eyelash extensions. Our eye cups are about 0.10 cm deep, so most people shouldn’t experience any discomfort.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
