            "heading": "How do the products work to encourage calm and sleep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>When you inhale the aroma, it travels through the olfactory nerves and interacts with the limbic system, the brain region that influences your mood and mental state. Smell significantly impacts brain activity. The essential oils in the Deep Sleep Collection are carefully selected for their calming and relaxing effects on both the mind and body.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__81831a55-2028-4d65-96f1-7ee83b79af1f-16653295208e06c57f-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your products natural?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>All of our products contain natural ingredients without harsh chemicals. We use 100% natural fragrances and pure essential oils. Our formulations are free from alcohol, phthalates, sulfates, synthetic colors, fragrances, and parabens. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629616673011__81831a55-2028-4d65-96f1-7ee83b79af1f-16653295208e06c57f-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where are your products manufactured?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Deep Sleep Set Collection is produced <strong>locally</strong> at our <strong>FDA licensed manufacturing plant</strong> in Quezon City, so you can sleep peacefully knowing that all our products are <strong>thoughtfully crafted </strong>with your needs in mind.</p>",
            "page": ""
